  "title": "The Connectivity-Code Number of C3 square C4 Is 16",
  "batch_label": "51",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "Let H=C_3 square C_4 be the Cartesian product on Z_3 x Z_4, and let m(H) be the maximum size of an arbitrary family C of edge subsets such that A triangle B is a connected spanning subgraph for every two distinct A,B in C. Then m(H)=16.",
